            "detailed_description": "There are drunken parties happening all over the neighborhood! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nBeer Pong League lets you play the good old classic Beer Pong game in a whole new environment! The rules are simple, Sink some balls in the opponents cups and see them get more and more drunk!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChallenge yourself in the skill of beer pong in our challenge mode or play multiplayer to climb the Beer Pong League! Beer Pong League is an easy to play game, but it is very hard to master, practice and practice to be the best while still havein the best time of your life!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCome join the party!",
